---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import AgentExperience from "../islands/AgentExperience";
import ClosingCTA from "../components/ClosingCTA.astro";
---
<Base title="CPL AI Chat Agents | Managed Website Chat Agents" description="Help website visitors with approved business answers, useful qualification, and a clear next step. CPL configures, tests, and manages AI chat agents for your business." jsonLd={{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Service',name:'CPL AI Chat Agents',serviceType:'AI chat agent implementation and management',provider:{'@type':'Organization',name:'Cyber Pirate Labs, LLC'}}}>
 <section class="service-intro"><div class="wrap service-intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">CPL AI Chat Agents</p><h1>A website visit.<br /><span>A better conversation.</span></h1><p class="hero-summary">Help visitors understand your services, share relevant details, and reach a sensible next step—with a chat agent configured around your business information and workflows.</p><a class="button" href="/demo/?interest=chat">Request a CPL Demo ↗</a></div><div class="service-note chat-note"><span>A VISITOR HAS A QUESTION.</span><blockquote>“Do you offer recurring cleaning in our area?”</blockquote><p>An approved answer. A relevant question. An organized request for the team.</p><small>FICTIONAL CONVERSATION · SAMPLE DATA</small></div></div></section>
 <section class="experience-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Explore a website conversation</p><h2>Less searching.<br />More understanding.</h2></div><p>Choose a sample business and follow the conversation. These fixed examples illustrate a setup, without a live AI request.</p></div><AgentExperience client:visible initialMode="chat" /></div></section>
 <section class="wrap service-details"><div><p class="eyebrow">A chat agent with business context</p><h2>Helpful answers.<br />A tone that fits.</h2></div><div class="detail-list"><article><h3>Approved business knowledge</h3><p>Your services, service areas, hours, common questions, and the information you want visitors to receive.</p></article><article><h3>Useful inquiry details</h3><p>Relevant follow-up questions help the visitor describe their request and provide contact details for review.</p></article><article><h3>Your tone, maintained</h3><p>We configure the way the agent responds and review changes as your business information evolves, within the agreed management scope.</p></article><article><h3>Boundaries &amp; escalation</h3><p>Unknown answers and out-of-scope requests get an approved follow-up path. A billing question can need a person without a fake “human has joined” message.</p></article></div></section>
 <section class="scope-band"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Fit the next step to your business</p><h2>A booking link is a link.<br />A booking needs confirmation.</h2><p>We can assess supported destinations for inquiry details, team notifications, or scheduling. Sharing an approved booking link is different from creating an appointment through an integration. A direct booking should only show success when the connected system confirms it.</p><p>CPL implements and manages agents using Stammer AI as the underlying platform. Website installation, supported connections, data handling, and ongoing changes are discussed for your scope.</p></div></section><ClosingCTA title="Turn the next visit into a useful conversation." text="Show us the questions your website visitors ask. We’ll discuss a chat agent that fits your information and the next steps you want to offer." />
</Base>
